# AI Vision 150

A beginner-friendly local web app that uses a laptop webcam and a lightweight YOLO object detection model to identify objects in real time.

This project is built for a school exhibition and celebrates the theme:

- AI VISION 150
- 150 Years of Human Learning → The Future of AI

## Features

- Live webcam feed in the browser
- Real-time object detection using YOLO
- Bounding boxes, object names, and confidence values
- Object count panel
- AI personality comments for detected objects
- Visitor Challenge mode
- Simple local setup using Flask, OpenCV, and YOLO
- No paid API required
- Works on a normal laptop without GPU

